      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft for your formal letter to the *Hausverwaltung*. You should keep the tone polite but firm, clearly stating the issue and the urgency. Remember to replace the bracketed information with your specific details.\n\n***\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Apartment Number]\n[Your Street Address]\n[Your City, Postal Code]\n[Your Email Address]\n[Your Phone Number]\n\n[Date]\n\nHausverwaltung [Name of Verwaltung]\n[Address of Hausverwaltung]\n[City, Postal Code of Hausverwaltung]\n\n**Subject: Urgent Repair Request – Malfunctioning Radiator in Apartment [Your Apartment Number]**\n\nDear Sir or Madam,\n\nI am writing to formally report a significant maintenance issue in my apartment, specifically that the radiator in the living room ceased functioning entirely yesterday, [Date]. As the weather is becoming increasingly cold, the apartment is rapidly becoming uncomfortably cold, which requires immediate attention. I must insist that this issue be treated with the utmost urgency, as a functional heating system is essential for habitable living conditions. I expect a response detailing the planned repair schedule by the end of this week, [Date of end of week].\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this critical matter",
