      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it looks good but could you add a bit more about the legal side? like, mention that according to German rental law (Mietrecht), the landlord has an obligation to maintain the property in a usable state, and if they don't fix it, I might have to look into a Mietminderung (rent reduction). i want it to sound like i know my rights so they don't just ignore me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
